{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Connect with a calm plan. Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for clarity, habits, and steady daily practices.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f7f8f6;--card:#ffffff;--ink:#1f2933;--muted:#667080;--accent:#7aa89a;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;line-height:1.4;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    .site{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;}
    header{padding:28px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.4px}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px}
    main{flex:1;padding:28px;max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;width:100%}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(30,40,50,0.06)}
    h1{margin:4px 0 8px;font-size:22px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}
    form{display:grid;gap:10px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e9eb;background:transparent}
    textarea{min-height:120px}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:white;border:0;cursor:pointer}
    .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid #e6e9eb;color:var(--ink)}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .tools{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .tool-cta{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .try-now{background:transparent;border:1px dashed var(--accent);padding:10px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent)}
    .checklist{margin-top:14px}
    table.check{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
    table.check td,table.check th{padding:8px;border-bottom:1px dashed #f0f0f0;text-align:left}
    .print-btn{margin-top:10px}
    footer{padding:18px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    /* modal */
    .modal{position:fixed;inset:0;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(12,16,18,0.45);z-index:60}
    .modal.open{display:flex}
    .panel{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;max-width:720px;width:92%;box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(10,20,30,0.3)}
    .modal .close{position:absolute;top:18px;right:18px;background:transparent;border:0;color:white;font-size:20px}
    .mode-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .mode-tabs button{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eee;background:#fafafa;cursor:pointer}
    .circle{width:160px;height:160px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,rgba(122,168,154,0.18),transparent 40%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:8px auto}
    .big{font-size:18px}
    .saved{margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    @media (max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="site">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">Essence</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Programs</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Plans</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <div class="grid">
        <section>
          <div class="card">
            <h1>Connect & compose a steadier week</h1>
            <p class="lead">A short note, a plan, or a first step — reach out and we'll co-create a reachable routine. Replace the hurry with a quiet scaffold.</p>
            <p class="meta">Call: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>

            <form id="contactForm" class="mt">
              <label for="name">Name</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your name">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com">
              <label for="message">Message</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="A brief note about what you need — goals, timing, or questions"></textarea>
              <div class="row">
                <button type="button" class="btn" id="primaryCta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
                <button type="button" class="ghost" id="openPractice">Try a practice</button>
              </div>
              <p class="small">Prefer a direct booking? <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Schedule time</a>.</p>
            </form>

            <div style="margin-top:14px">
              <strong>Office</strong>
              <div class="small">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — Sessions via video, phone, or quiet in-person meetings.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
            <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Habit builder — 7-day challenge</h2>
            <p class="small">Choose up to 7 small actions. We’ll make a printable checklist you can carry or pin.</p>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
              <select id="startDay">
                <option>Start Monday</option>
                <option>Start Tuesday</option>
                <option>Start Wednesday</option>
                <option>Start Thursday</option>
                <option>Start Friday</option>
                <option>Start Saturday</option>
                <option>Start Sunday</option>
              </select>
              <button class="ghost" id="presetsBtn">Use gentle preset</button>
              <button class="btn" id="generateBtn">Generate checklist</button>
            </div>

            <div class="checklist" id="checklistArea" aria-live="polite"></div>

          </div>
        </section>

        <aside class="card tools">
          <div>
            <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Quick practices</h3>
            <p class="small">Short practices to steady a moment. Open one and try it now; each is timed and guided.</p>
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
              <div class="tool-cta">
                <button class="try-now" data-mode="breathing">Try breathing</button>
                <span class="small">(2–4 minutes)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="tool-cta">
                <button class="try-now" data-mode="journaling">Try journaling</button>
                <span class="small">(3–6 minutes)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="tool-cta">
                <button class="try-now" data-mode="intention">Set an intention</button>
                <span class="small">(1–3 minutes)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="border-top:1px dashed #f0f0f0;padding-top:12px">
            <h4 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Need help deciding?</h4>
            <p class="small">Share a quick note above and I’ll suggest a fitting 7-day practice aligned with your rhythm.</p>
            <div style="margin-top:8px"><button class="btn" id="suggestBtn">Suggest a starter</button></div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — quiet frameworks for daily steadiness • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal: guided practice -->
  <div id="modal" class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="panel" role="document">
      <button class="close" id="closeModal" aria-label="Close">×</button>
      <div id="modalInner">
        <div class="mode-tabs" id="modeTabs">
          <button data-mode="breathing">Breathing</button>
          <button data-mode="journaling">Journaling</button>
          <button data-mode="intention">Intention</button>
        </div>

        <div id="modeContent">
          <!-- breathing -->
          <div data-panel="breathing" class="mode-panel">
            <h3 class="big">Centered breath</h3>
            <p class="small">Follow a slow 4–4–4 cycle. Watch the circle breathe with you.</p>
            <div class="circle" id="breathCircle"><div id="breathLabel">Ready</div></div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin-top:8px">
              <button class="btn" id="startBreath">Start</button>
              <button class="ghost" id="stopBreath">Stop</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- journaling -->
          <div data-panel="journaling" class="mode-panel" style="display:none">
            <h3 class="big">Timed journaling</h3>
            <p class="small">Choose a 3-minute prompt. Write freely; keep it simple.</p>
            <select id="journalPrompt">
              <option>What eased me today?</option>
              <option>One small success I can celebrate</option>
              <option>What I want to let go of before bed</option>
              <option>Three things I can do tomorrow</option>
            </select>
            <div style="margin-top:8px"><textarea id="journalArea" placeholder="Write whatever comes…"></textarea></div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
              <button class="btn" id="startJournal">Start 3-min timer</button>
              <button class="ghost" id="saveJournal">Save entry</button>
            </div>
            <div class="saved" id="savedJournals"></div>
          </div>

          <!-- intention -->
          <div data-panel="intention" class="mode-panel" style="display:none">
            <h3 class="big">Set an intention</h3>
            <p class="small">A few quick prompts to shape a clear, kind intention for the next day.</p>
            <ol style="padding-left:18px">
              <li>What would make tomorrow feel lighter?</li>
              <li>What’s one small action that supports that?</li>
              <li>How will you remind yourself gently?</li>
            </ol>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
              <input id="intentAction" placeholder="I will…" type="text">
              <button class="btn" id="saveIntent">Capture</button>
            </div>
            <div class="saved" id="intentSaved"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Accessibility helpers
    const modal = document.getElementById('modal');
    const modeTabs = document.getElementById('modeTabs');
    const modePanels = document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]');
    function openModal(mode){
      modal.classList.add('open'); modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');
      switchTo(mode || 'breathing');
      document.body.style.overflow='hidden';
    }
    function closeModal(){
      modal.classList.remove('open'); modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
      document.body.style.overflow='';
      stopBreathing();
    }

    document.getElementById('openPractice').addEventListener('click',()=>openModal());
    document.getElementById('closeModal').addEventListener('click',closeModal);
    document.querySelectorAll('.try-now').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',e=>openModal(e.currentTarget.dataset.mode)));
    document.getElementById('modeTabs').addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target.dataset.mode) switchTo(e.target.dataset.mode)});

    function switchTo(mode){
      modePanels.forEach(p=>p.style.display = p.dataset.panel===mode ? '' : 'none');
    }

    // Breathing practice (4-4-4 simple)
    let breathTimer=null;let breathPhase=0;let breathCount=0;const breathLabel=document.getElementById('breathLabel');
    const circle=document.getElementById('breathCircle');
    function breatheStep(){
      // phases: 0 inhale,1 hold,2 exhale,3 hold
      const phaseOrder=['Inhale','Hold','Exhale','Hold'];
      const duration=4; // seconds each
      breathPhase = (breathPhase+1)%4; // progress
      breathCount += 0;
      const label = phaseOrder[breathPhase];
      breathLabel.textContent = label;
      // animate circle
      if(label==='Inhale'){ circle.style.transform='scale(1.12)'; }
      else if(label==='Exhale'){ circle.style.transform='scale(0.88)'; }
      else { circle.style.transform='scale(1)'; }
    }
    function startBreathing(){
      if(breathTimer) return;
      breathPhase = -1; breatheStep();
      breathTimer = setInterval(breatheStep,4000);
    }
    function stopBreathing(){
      clearInterval(breathTimer); breathTimer=null; breatheLabelReset(); circle.style.transform='scale(1)';
    }
    function breatheLabelReset(){ breathLabel.textContent='Ready'; }
    document.getElementById('startBreath').addEventListener('click',startBreathing);
    document.getElementById('stopBreath').addEventListener('click',stopBreathing);

    // Journaling simple timer/save
    let journalTimer=null; let journalSeconds=0;
    const journalArea=document.getElementById('journalArea');
    document.getElementById('startJournal').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const total = 180; journalSeconds=0; if(journalTimer) clearInterval(journalTimer);
      journalTimer = setInterval(()=>{
        journalSeconds++;
        const left = total - journalSeconds; document.getElementById('startJournal').textContent = left>0 ? 'Time left: '+left+'s' : 'Done';
        if(left<=0){ clearInterval(journalTimer); journalTimer=null; document.getElementById('startJournal').textContent='Start 3-min timer'; }
      },1000);
    });
    document.getElementById('saveJournal').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const txt = journalArea.value.trim(); if(!txt) return alert('Write a short note first.');
      const wrap = document.createElement('div'); wrap.textContent = new Date().toLocaleString()+" — "+txt; document.getElementById('savedJournals').prepend(wrap); journalArea.value='';
    });

    // Intention capture
    document.getElementById('saveIntent').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const val = document.getElementById('intentAction').value.trim(); if(!val) return;
      const node = document.createElement('div'); node.textContent = '• '+val; document.getElementById('intentSaved').prepend(node); document.getElementById('intentAction').value='';
    });

    // Habit builder
    const presetsBtn = document.getElementById('presetsBtn');
    const generateBtn = document.getElementById('generateBtn');
    const checklistArea = document.getElementById('checklistArea');
    const startDaySel = document.getElementById('startDay');
    const defaultPreset = ['5 min breathing','10 min walk','One glass of water','Write 3 things','Stretch shoulders','Plan tomorrow','Bed by 11pm'];

    presetsBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      // show inputs to edit
      checklistArea.innerHTML = '';
      const container = document.createElement('div');
      for(let i=0;i<7;i++){
        const el = document.createElement('input'); el.type='text'; el.value = defaultPreset[i]||''; el.style.marginBottom='6px'; el.style.width='100%'; container.appendChild(el);
      }
      checklistArea.appendChild(container);
    });

    function dayNamesFrom(startIndex){
      const days=['Monday','Tuesday','Wednesday','Thursday','Friday','Saturday','Sunday'];
      const idx = startIndex;
      return days.slice(idx).concat(days.slice(0,idx));
    }

    generateBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      // collect habits
      let inputs = checklistArea.querySelectorAll('input');
      let habits = [];
      if(inputs.length){ inputs.forEach(i=>habits.push(i.value.trim()||'—')); }
      if(habits.length<7){ habits = defaultPreset.slice(0,7); }

      const startIndex = startDaySel.selectedIndex || 0;
      const days = dayNamesFrom(startIndex);

      // build table
      let html = '<table class="check"><thead><tr><th>Habit</th>';
      days.forEach(d=>{ html += '<th>'+d+'</th>'; });
      html += '</tr></thead><tbody>';
      habits.forEach((h,hi)=>{
        html += '<tr><td>'+(hi+1)+'. '+h+'</td>';
        for(let d=0;d<7;d++) html += '<td><input type="checkbox" aria-label="'+h+' '+days[d]+'"></td>';
        html += '</tr>';
      });
      html += '</tbody></table>';
      html += '<div class="print-btn"><button class="btn" id="printChecklist">Print or save</button></div>';
      checklistArea.innerHTML = html;
      document.getElementById('printChecklist').addEventListener('click',()=>{
        const win = window.open('', '_blank');
        const doc = win.document;
        doc.write('<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>7-day checklist</title>');
        doc.write('<style>body{font-family:system-ui;padding:20px;color:#111}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}td,th{padding:8px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left}</style>');
        doc.write('</head><body>');
        doc.write('<h2>'+ (document.querySelector('h1') ? document.querySelector('h1').textContent : '7-day checklist') +'</h2>');
        doc.write(document.querySelector('#checklistArea').innerHTML);
        doc.write('</body></html>');
        doc.close();
        win.focus();
        // small delay to ensure content ready
        setTimeout(()=>win.print(),300);
      });
    });

    // Suggest starter (very simple heuristic)
    document.getElementById('suggestBtn').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const note = (document.getElementById('message')||{}).value || '';
      let suggested = ['5 min breathing','10 min walk','Hydrate: glass of water','Stretch 3 min','Write one gratitude','Prep one task','Sleep routine: wind down'];
      if(/sleep|tired/i.test(note)) suggested[6] = 'Bed by a fixed hour';
      if(/energy|motiva/i.test(note)) suggested[1] = 'Short movement burst';
      checklistArea.innerHTML = '';
      const container = document.createElement('div');
      suggested.forEach(s=>{ const i = document.createElement('input'); i.type='text'; i.value=s; i.style.width='100%'; i.style.marginBottom='6px'; container.appendChild(i); });
      checklistArea.appendChild(container);
      window.scrollTo({top:document.getElementById('checklistArea').offsetTop,behavior:'smooth'});
    });

    // Primary CTA (simulate send)
    document.getElementById('primaryCta').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      const message = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();
      if(!email && !message) return alert('Please share an email or a short message so I can reply.');
      alert('Thanks — I received your note. I’ll reply soon.');
      // in a real site submit via AJAX or server
    });

    // close modal on backdrop click
    modal.addEventListener('click',e=>{ if(e.target===modal) closeModal(); });
    document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{ if(e.key==='Escape') closeModal(); });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"}  
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for the wellness_coach site (slug: wellness_coach-MORE-2026-02-17T05-13-20-335Z-044).

Files in this bundle:
- contact.html — the contact page with two interactive features: a 7-day habit builder (printable checklist) and a guided practice modal (breathing, journaling, intention-setting).

Placeholders to replace in contact.html:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}} (optional, not used directly here)
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Key features and how to use them locally:
1) Habit builder (7-day challenge)
   - Use the "gentle preset" to populate editable inputs, or manually edit the habit entries.
   - Choose a start day from the dropdown (Start Monday...Start Sunday).
   - Click "Generate checklist" to produce a table with 7 days and checkboxes for each habit.
   - Click "Print or save" to open a print-ready window; use the browser print dialog to save as PDF or print.
   - "Suggest a starter" pulls a small heuristic preset based on the message field and fills the inputs.

2) Guided practice modal
   - Open via the "Try a practice" button or any of the small "Try breathing / Try journaling / Set an intention" buttons in the sidebar.
   - Breathing: a simple 4-4-4 cycle with an animated circle and labels. Start/Stop controls.
   - Journaling: choose a prompt, start a 3-minute timer (counts down), write in the textarea, and save entries that will appear beneath.
   - Intention: quick capture of a simple intention; saved items are listed below.

Accessibility & behavior notes:
- Modal traps are minimal: Escape closes, clicking backdrop closes, and the panel is focusable.
- All interactive features are implemented in plain JavaScript — no external libraries or CDNs.
- No external assets are bundled here. The page references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for background texture; ensure that file exists and is unique for this project.

Customization suggestions:
- Replace placeholders with real values.
- Adjust the preset habits and prompts to match your coaching language.
- Hook the contact form and CTA to your backend or scheduling solution ({{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} is included as a link target).

Design notes:
- Layout follows a quiet, minimal aesthetic that supports short guided UX moments and printable artifacts.
- Keep interactions simple and short; the intent is to encourage small daily practices, frameworks, and habit formation (no medical claims).

If you need a matching assets/img/pattern.svg (unique SVG pattern) created for this project, let me know and I will provide a lightweight inline SVG file to drop into that path."}
BUNDLE_END
